{"id":"n91762-1-8","stage":2,"title":"좌석 · 坐席","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91762-1-8-1","ko":"부산으로 내려가는 버스 표가 남아 있나요?","zh":"去釜山的大巴还有票吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부산으로","meaning":"釜山","explanation":"부산：釜山；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"부산으로","audio":"/audio/79c36109d8bebedf8b32.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부산으로","audio":"/audio/79c36109d8bebedf8b32.mp3"}},{"text":"내려가는","meaning":"往地方去、下去（此处指去釜山）","explanation":"내려가다 可指从中心地区到地方去；此处说去釜山，不必理解成沿斜坡向下走。","readings":[{"term":"내려가다","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63723","senseId":"2","lemma":"내려가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려가는","audio":"/audio/549643330c7acea9bbd0.mp3"}},{"text":"버스","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}},{"text":"표가","meaning":"票，券","explanation":"표：票，券；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"표","audio":"/audio/40ec1a2864faf2b46f95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71353","senseId":"1","lemma":"표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"표가","audio":"/audio/73ea982ce2ce953dad89.mp3"}},{"text":"남아","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남아","audio":"/audio/6ab4b405a40e3c3ced24.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d27a99abb5cf233c","term":"내려가다","zh":"往地方去、下去（此处指去釜山）","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3","entryId":"63723","definition":"往地方去、下去（此处指去釜山）","pronunciation":["내려가다"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"40ec1a2864faf2b4","term":"표","zh":"票，券","audio":"/audio/40ec1a2864faf2b46f95.mp3","entryId":"71353","definition":"证明具有某种权利的纸条。","pronunciation":["표"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2026963137c4c4283704.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91762-1-8-2","ko":"죄송하지만 지금은 남은 좌석이 없습니다.","zh":"抱歉，现在没有空座了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송하지만","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송하지만","audio":"/audio/8f5e03e932bf717d558b.mp3"}},{"text":"지금은","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금은","audio":"/audio/981101a536ceceb06592.mp3"}},{"text":"남은","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남은","audio":"/audio/0736fbdfe295646df99b.mp3"}},{"text":"좌석이","meaning":"坐席，座位","explanation":"좌석：坐席，座位；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"좌석","audio":"/audio/1f892096c0a4cb6ebdc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91762","senseId":"1","lemma":"좌석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좌석이","audio":"/audio/f66a1bbb3c73072c3590.mp3"}},{"text":"없습니다.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없습니다","audio":"/audio/795d658e7bfcf08e6bc8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]},{"id":"1f892096c0a4cb6e","term":"좌석","zh":"坐席，座位","audio":"/audio/1f892096c0a4cb6ebdc4.mp3","entryId":"91762","definition":"供人去坐的位子。","pronunciation":["좌ː석"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/041dadbdabde84c5d1de.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.538,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91762","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":86,"sequenceScore":2.3647,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["抱歉，现在没有空座了。","去釜山的大巴还有票吗？","油价涨得真吓人，简直没个头。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["去釜山的大巴还有票吗？","油价涨得真吓人，简直没个头。","抱歉，现在没有空座了。"],"answer":2}]}
